  "name": "fetch",
  "vibe": "A flat-vector park afternoon with a story in it: a dog runs a ball across the meadow and delivers it, and the whole film is that errand. Pale blue sky, a sun with twelve turning rays, drifting clouds, rolling hills in three greens, a picket fence and a swaying grass field. Every surface is a STICKER — cream paper behind a solid ink outline and a hard offset shadow with no blur anywhere — set in a soft rounded display face with one warm orange accent. The signature is BOUNCE: everything arrives on an overshoot and settles, the dog's run cycle drags the park past on five parallax layers, and hearts, sparkles, dust and paw prints carry the ambience. One screenshot slot, and it is a portrait PHONE. Authored landscape-first (16:9) as a native GSAP + DOM/SVG composition. Best for pets, family, food, community, education and any brand that should feel warm and unserious.",
